    "Summerland's hillside remodels punch above the village's size: ocean-view cottages rebuilt with Viking stoves, Thermador cooktops, panel-front Bosch and Miele dishwashers, the occasional Sub-Zero column fitted into a kitchen the width of a hallway. Estate-grade equipment in cottage-grade spaces — which makes the install clearances, not the brands, the hard part.",
    "We bring the same OEM-parts discipline here that we run in <a href=\"/santa-barbara/\">Santa Barbara</a> and Montecito, plus the extraction patience tight kitchens demand. A built-in that takes two people and floor pads to remove still gets proper service — being hard to reach is no reason to replace a Sub-Zero with decades of luxury service life left in it."
  ],
  brands: ['Sub-Zero', 'Viking', 'Thermador', 'Miele', 'Bosch', 'Wolf']
};

